WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:13.641
Barka da zuwa WODDI Institute. Wannan gajeren jagora zai nuna miki yadda ake amfani da manhajar, mataki-mataki.

2
00:00:13.641 --> 00:00:26.877
WODDI Institute ilimi ne kyauta ga mata a faɗin Afirka: ƙwarewar aiki, masu ba da shawara da takardun shaida, duk a wayarki.

3
00:00:27.427 --> 00:00:36.669
Da farko, zaɓi harshenki. Danna shi a saman shafin. Manhajar za ta koma harshenki.

4
00:00:37.219 --> 00:00:41.479
Don shiga, danna maɓallin farawa.

5
00:00:41.479 --> 00:00:43.837
Rubuta cikakken sunanki.

6
00:00:43.837 --> 00:00:53.612
Za ki iya yin rajista da imel ɗinki ko lambar wayarki. A nan, muna amfani da lambar waya.

7
00:00:53.612 --> 00:00:57.933
Zaɓi ƙasarki, sannan ki zaɓi rukuninki.

8
00:00:57.933 --> 00:01:06.358
Yi kalmar sirri mai haruffa ko lambobi shida ko fiye, sannan ki danna Ƙirƙiri asusu.

9
00:01:06.358 --> 00:01:12.942
Asusunki ya shirya. Danna maɓallin don buɗe shafinki.

10
00:01:13.492 --> 00:01:16.809
Lokaci na gaba, danna Shiga.

11
00:01:16.809 --> 00:01:27.079
Saka lambar waya ko imel ɗin da kika yi amfani da shi, da kalmar sirrinki. Za ki iya kuma danna Ci gaba da Google.

12
00:01:27.079 --> 00:01:34.954
Idan kin manta kalmar sirrinki, danna Na manta kalmar sirri, za mu taimaka miki.

13
00:01:35.504 --> 00:01:44.167
Wannan shi ne shafinki na farko. Babban katin koyaushe yana nuna matakinki na gaba.

14
00:01:44.167 --> 00:01:57.132
Menu da ke ƙasa yana kai ki ko'ina: gida, karatu, al'umma, mai ba da shawara, bayananki da ƙari.

15
00:01:57.682 --> 00:02:11.616
Kowa yana farawa da Rooting, wato matakin tushe: darussa takwas gajeru game da WODDI da tafiyarki. Danna maɓallin farawa.

16
00:02:11.616 --> 00:02:14.288
Buɗe darasi na farko.

17
00:02:14.288 --> 00:02:16.563
Karanta darasin har ƙarshe.

18
00:02:16.563 --> 00:02:26.794
Amsa ƙaramar tambayar, sannan ki danna Aika ki kammala. Darasi na gaba zai buɗe. Kammala dukkan takwas.

19
00:02:27.344 --> 00:02:34.817
Idan kin gama Rooting, Blueprint zai buɗe. Danna katin Blueprint.

20
00:02:34.817 --> 00:02:47.130
Blueprint yana da ginshiƙai uku: Asali, Manufa, da Tasiri da Gado. Kammala su bi da bi, ta hanya ɗaya.

21
00:02:47.680 --> 00:03:00.361
Bayan Blueprint, Cibiyar Darussa za ta buɗe, tana da darussa fiye da ɗari. Danna alamar karatu a ƙasa.

22
00:03:00.361 --> 00:03:05.534
Danna Duba darussa, ki zaɓi darasin da kike so.

23
00:03:05.534 --> 00:03:12.029
Shafin darasin yana nuna abin da za ki koya. Danna Fara darasi.

24
00:03:12.029 --> 00:03:17.927
Karanta kowane darasi, ko ki danna maɓallin belun kunne don saurara.

25
00:03:17.927 --> 00:03:31.104
Danna Ci gaba don wucewa gaba. Kowane babi yana ƙarewa da ƙaramar jarabawa, kuma darasin yana ƙarewa da jarabawar ƙarshe.

26
00:03:31.654 --> 00:03:40.297
Idan kin ci jarabawar ƙarshe, za ki sami takardar shaida. Don ganinta, danna Ƙari.

27
00:03:40.297 --> 00:03:42.795
Sannan ki danna Takardun shaida.

28
00:03:42.795 --> 00:03:44.894
Danna Duba ki sauke.

29
00:03:44.894 --> 00:03:54.994
Danna Sauke PDF, ko PNG don hoto. Kowa zai iya tabbatar da takardarki a intanet da lambarta.

30
00:03:55.544 --> 00:04:05.326
Takardar shaidarki tana buɗe miki filin waɗanda suka kammala. A shafin farko, danna Al'ummar tsofaffin ɗalibai.

31
00:04:05.326 --> 00:04:16.681
Raba nasara, yi tambaya ko ki ba da taimako. Rubuta saƙonki ki danna Wallafa.

32
00:04:16.681 --> 00:04:28.425
A nan kuma za ki iya shiga ƙungiyoyi, ki haɗu da sauran waɗanda suka kammala, ki sami damammaki da tarurruka.

33
00:04:28.975 --> 00:04:34.991
Don sayar da kaya ko ƙwarewa, danna Shagona a Marketplace.

34
00:04:34.991 --> 00:04:41.795
Danna Sabon talla, sannan ki zaɓi kaya, sabis ko ƙwarewa.

35
00:04:41.795 --> 00:04:48.032
Ba shi suna mai bayyana, ki zaɓi rukuni.

36
00:04:48.032 --> 00:05:00.713
Bayyana shi, ki saka farashinki.

37
00:05:00.713 --> 00:05:07.891
Ƙara lambar WhatsApp ɗinki ki danna Wallafa talla. Masu saya za su tuntuɓe ki kai tsaye.

38
00:05:08.441 --> 00:05:14.310
Kina buƙatar taimako a kowane lokaci? Danna Mai ba da shawara.

39
00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:23.225
Rubuta tambayarki ki danna aika. Mai ba ki shawara za ta amsa da harshenki.

40
00:05:23.225 --> 00:05:26.906
Za ki iya kuma danna makirufo ki yi magana.

41
00:05:26.906 --> 00:05:31.181
Don fara sabuwar hira, danna Share hira.

42
00:05:31.731 --> 00:05:39.300
Don gyara yadda manhajar take aiki, danna Ƙari, sannan Saituna.

43
00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:43.772
A nan za ki iya kunna ko kashe yanayin duhu,

44
00:05:43.772 --> 00:05:45.811
ki ƙara girman rubutu,

45
00:05:45.811 --> 00:05:53.603
ki canza harshen manhajar, ki kuma kunna sanarwar waya, don kada ki rasa wani saƙo.

46
00:05:53.603 --> 00:05:55.749
Fita yana can ƙasa.

47
00:05:56.299 --> 00:06:03.038
Don sake kallon wannan jagora, danna Ƙari, sannan Yadda ake amfani.

48
00:06:03.038 --> 00:06:10.775
Kin shirya. Barka da zuwa WODDI Institute. Babu macen da za a bari a baya.

